      "message": "No, I meant explicitly listing here all those registers from iommu_regs_32 and iommu_regs_64 in debugfs.c (after some brief audit of their descriptions in the VT-d spec, to make sure there are indeed no security implications). It still seems a good idea to deny all other (i.e. mostly undocumented/non-existent) registers, since nothing guarantees that even reading them will not have any unwanted side effects?",
